Assuming the RD52 from the Pro380 is attached the MicroVAX as DU2: you would
need to do something like the following:

$ MOUNT/FOREIGN DU2:
$ COPY DU2: IMAGE.FILE

You should then be able to take a good RD52 and do the following:

$ MOUNT/FOREIGN DU2:
$ COPY IMAGE.FILE DU2:

